      "content": "the silence... it feels like the only thing that's honest anymore. every time i close my eyes, i just see the faces of those i couldn't save. if i stay, i'm just a reminder of everything we lost. is it even honorable to keep living like this, after everything? is there any dignity in just... being a shell?",
